    "body": "fix on issue/3276-site-only-dispatch · PR #3277 · pinned by site_only_dispatch_runs_only_site_and_pages · merges when reviewed\n\nSteps 1 and 2 are done:\n\n- The branch `site/v0.25.0` is pushed. Its head is `3bc320a8c`: v0.25.0 plus the site and docs part of PR #3274, without the V-Carve parts. The site tests pass on it (82 tests OK). It changes only `site/` and `docs/`.\n- PR #3277 adds the input `site_only` to the existing `workflow_dispatch` of `release.yml`. The PR uses `Refs #3276`, because the deploy is still owed.\n\nSteps 3 and 4 are still open:\n\n1. The owner adds the deployment branch policy `site/*` to the environment `github-pages`.\n2. After PR #3277 merges, dispatch one time: `gh workflow run release.yml --ref site/v0.25.0 -f site_only=true`.\n",
